</div>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-text-header mb-1">Compras</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-text-body">Controla el gasto y el abastecimiento de tu negocio</p>
</div>
<button class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-primary px-6 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(178,231,255,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(178,231,255,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 z-10">
